L1559|X|<computer_use> "A short file (under about 100 lines) is written in one call. A long one is built in steps... then checked. Open the result to check it, and fix and rebuild when it is wrong."|Reference: short = one call, straight to outputs; review/refine only for long files. ArcNave adds a check-fix-rebuild step for every file with no stopping point. This caused the 7-round Word loop.
